<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Reservation Updated</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #17a2b8; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
    <h1><%= @salon_name %></h1>
    <h2>Reservation Updated</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;">
    <p>Dear <strong><%= @user.name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Your reservation has been updated as shown below. Please review the new details.</p>

    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #6c757d;">
      <h3>Previous</h3>
      <p><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong> <%= @previous_details[:start_time].strftime('%B %d, %Y at %H:%M') %> - <%= @previous_details[:end_time].strftime('%H:%M') %></p>
      <p><strong>Course:</strong> <%= @previous_details[:course] %></p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8;">
      <h3>Updated</h3>
      <p><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong> <%= @reservation.start_time.strftime('%B %d, %Y at %H:%M') %> - <%= @reservation.end_time.strftime('%H:%M') %></p>
      <p><strong>Course:</strong> <%= @reservation.course %></p>
    </div>

    <p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
    <p><strong><%= @salon_name %></strong><br>
    TEL: 080-9692-1177<br>
    Email: mobilis.stretch@gmail.com<br>
    Business Hours: 10:00 - 20:00</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
